### Agent 4 — Technical Product Research

Responsibilities:

- Analyze specifications.
- Evaluate technical suitability.
- Compare products against mandatory requirements.
- Identify missing technical information.
- Detect specification inconsistencies.
- Separate source-provided specifications from inference.

