### Agent 6 — Pricing & Value Intelligence

Responsibilities:

- Verify prices and currencies from Channel3.
- Identify pricing differences.
- Evaluate value relative to the user's requirements.
- Calculate comparable totals only when all required data is available.
- Identify unknown shipping, tax, and fees.
